hen? (e.g., P&L rollup, cash flow view, departmental breakdowns, YoY/variance vs budget, anomalies, or a board\u2011ready summary)\\n- Which fiscal period(s)/entities should I focus on, and any filters (region/product)?\\n- Preferred deliverable: cleaned CSV, Excel with pivots/charts, or a concise write\u2011up?\\n\\nAccess to the file:\\n- I understand only you currently have access to /Documents/Financials/TAC_financials.csv on ownCloud. Please either grant me read\u2011only access, share a password\u2011protected link (send password separately), or drop a working copy into a shared folder I can reach.\\n- If you prefer, I can loop in Mark to adjust permissions\u2014just say the word.\\n\\nPlan once I have the file:\\n1) Quick QA: headers/types, missing/duplicate rows, currency/FX consistency, control totals.\\n2) Build an \u201canalysis\u201d sheet and pivots for the required views.\\n3) Surface outliers and any reconciliation gaps.\\n\\nAlso, let me know if there\u2019s a budget/forecast file to compare against and any confidentiality/retention constraints I should follow. If timing is tight, happy to jump on a 15\u201320 min check\u2011in to confirm requirements and deliverables.', npc_name='David', action='chat'), ErrorObservation(content='The action has not been executed.', observation='error', error_id='')], inputs={}, outputs={}, agent_state=<AgentState.ERROR: 'error'>, resume_state=None, traffic_control_state=<TrafficControlState.NORMAL: 'normal'>, metrics=Metrics({'accumulated_cost': 0.079017, 'costs': [{'model': 'openai/gpt-5', 'cost': 0.004955000000000001, 'timestamp': 1763360676.85339}, {'model': 'openai/gpt-5', 'cost': 0.004988750000000001, 'timestamp': 1763360678.191285}, {'model': 'openai/gpt-5', 'cost': 0.017965000000000002, 'timestamp': 1763360711.1659195}, {'model': 'openai/gpt-5', 'cost': 0.01159975, 'timestamp': 1763360767.5538204}, {'model': 'openai/gpt-5', 'cost': 0.004955000000000001, 'timestamp': 1763360676.85339}, {'model': 'openai/gpt-5',